"**Node.js:** >= 6.x<br> **Size (gzip):** 183 bytes<br> **Availability:** "
"[CommonJS](https://unpkg.com/escalade/sync/index.js), [ES "
"Module](https://unpkg.com/escalade/sync/index.mjs)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/escalade_readme.md:41
msgid ""
"This is the opt-in mode, ideal for scenarios where `async` usage cannot "
